Error [E0121]: `v` was consumed by `keep`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_call_after_written_capture_moved.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     add()
    |     ^^^
  --> tests/ui/lambda_call_after_written_capture_moved.jet:9:17
    |
  9 |     print(keep(^v))
    |                 ^ `v` moved to `keep` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `v` after the move, or give `keep` a copy with `v.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
